# ───────────────────────── secrets ─────────────────────────
.env
*.env
!.env.example

# ───────── runtime data + PII (DEFAULT-DENY the whole dir) ──────────
# data/ holds the user's profile, résumés, application state, browser session cookies
# (LinkedIn li_at!), spend, ledgers — none of it belongs in a public repo. Ignore everything,
# then allow back ONLY non-sensitive reference/seed files that are genuinely code/config.
data/*
!data/h1b_sponsors.json
!data/board_sponsors.json
!data/company_seeds.yaml
!data/company_caps.json
!data/browser_gated_vendors.json
!data/discovered_sources.json
!data/gov_vendors.json
!data/.gitkeep

